    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch, another failure. He's flying in a nice arc this time though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did he land?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea. He'll come running back after a while anyway. Let's keep going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, what does this tube connect to\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, this looks like a good port, I'm plugging it in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, is it working?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Do you even know what you're doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you yelling for? I've never seen an engine like this before, just let me experiment a bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to try!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think this tube goes here. What does this button do then? Who cares, just press it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who's messing around! It obviously goes here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_072"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you two idiots doing? The gas pipe isn't even connected. Let me do it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, what does the gas pipe go to... Never mind, this port looks bigger, this is probably it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, somebody try to start it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Youngsters nowadays really have no respect for their elders. No one bothered to look for me after I got blasted away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, High Priest, you always come back safe. Everyone's gotten used to it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop wasting time, let's get on with the testing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, yeah, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
