    {
        "text": "Ohh! Great Chief, it's moving!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This wonderful engine sound! I've never heard anything so amazing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "avg_npc_072",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, told you I'd get it done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as you saw, Great Chief, it moved just like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We plugged this tube here and that one there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_072",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how we built the Big Ugly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh, the Big Ugly, once but a pile of scrap metal, is now truly majestic. I'm so moved. It makes me want to sing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're bad at singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_074",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry?! Fine. I think I have a real talent for singing though... Terrible!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Maybe it's a style problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that's right. That has to be the reason. Next time, I'll try singing in bel canto!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
